==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|EX Deoxys|Starmie|48}} from the {{TCG|EX Deoxys}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Starmie}}.
*'''Wave Splash''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Vending|Golduck|S3}} from {{TCG|Expansion Sheet 3}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

